    "protected": false,
    "rendered": "<div class=\"xyz-content\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<ol class=\"m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <a href=\"/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Home </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <a href=\"/services/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Services </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <span aria-current=\"page\">Business name registration</span> </li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Services</p>\n<h1 class=\"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl sm:text-4xl\">Business name registration</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[1.0625rem]\">Register a business name with ASIC so you can trade under something other than your own name or your company name — after we have checked the name is available, clear of obvious trade mark conflicts, and actually needed.</p>\n</p></div>\n<section class=\"shell mt-10\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\">\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Our fee</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0\"> <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-2xl font-medium\">$79</span> <span class=\"ml-2 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">fixed, inc. GST</span> </p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Fixed, agreed in writing, no work begins before you accept it.</p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Government charges</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold\">ASIC registration fee</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">For a one- or three-year registration, passed on at cost and shown separately. We never mark it up.</p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Turnaround</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold\">1 business day</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Once your ABN is active. ASIC usually registers the name the same day it is lodged.</p>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr]\">\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl\">What&#8217;s included</h2>\n<ul class=\"mt-5 list-none border-t border-rule p-0\">\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">A check of whether you need a business name at all — trading under your own name, or your company&#8217;s exact name, does not</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">An availability search against the ASIC register</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">A first-pass search of the trade mark register, so you don&#8217;t build a brand on someone else&#8217;s mark</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">Registration with ASIC for one or three years, linked to your ABN</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">A reminder before the renewal falls due</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl\">How it runs</h2>\n<ol class=\"mt-5 list-none border-t border-rule p-0\">\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 01 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">Verify your identity online — about three minutes on your phone, included in the fee. Every client, every service, no exceptions. <a href=\"/identity-verification/\">How it works</a>.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 02 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">Tell us the name you want and the ABN it will sit under.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 03 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">We check availability and flag anything too close to an existing name or trade mark.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 04 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">We lodge the registration with ASIC and pay the fee on your behalf.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 05 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">You get the ASIC confirmation, and we diary the renewal.</span> </li>\n</ol></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<div class=\"card p-6 bg-paper-sunk\">\n<h2 class=\"text-lg\">A business name is not a trade mark</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 max-w-3xl text-[0.9375rem]\">Registering a business name lets you trade under it. It does not give you ownership of the name or stop anyone else using something similar — only a registered trade mark does that. If the name matters to the brand, we will tell you when it is worth protecting.</p>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\" id=\"start\">\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl\">Start it</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-6 max-w-2xl text-[0.9375rem]\"> Tell us what you need and we will come back with a fixed fee and what we need from you. No obligation, and no charge for telling you that you don&#8217;t need this. </p>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"> <a href=\"/get-a-quote/\" class=\"btn\">Get a quote</a> <a href=\"/contact/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Contact Us</a> </div>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> Prefer to talk it through? Call 0407 179 179 and we will take the details over the phone. Please don&#8217;t include your tax file number either way — we ask for it securely once an accountant is working on your file. </p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-12 mb-16\">\n<div class=\"card p-6\">\n<h2 class=\"text-lg\">Related services</h2>\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"/services/abn-application/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">ABN application</a> <a href=\"/services/company-registration/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">Company setup</a> <a href=\"/services/start-up-bundle/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">Start-up bundle</a></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div hidden class=\"xyz-schema\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/business-name-registration/#service\",\"name\":\"Business name registration\",\"url\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/business-name-registration/\",\"description\":\"Register a business name with ASIC after we check it's available, clear of obvious trade mark conflicts and actually needed. Fixed fee, agreed before we start.\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"Australia\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"XYZ Accounting\",\"url\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/\"}</script></div>\n"
